# Auto-detect text files and normalize line endings to LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly mark binary files
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary


# Vendored history is EVIDENCE — store the bytes that were captured.
#
# `* text=auto eol=lf` above would rewrite the claw-2/claw-3 conversion
# transcripts from CRLF to LF (1,995 and 1,982 lines each). They are raw
# terminal captures of the real bazooka runs on 2026-03-07 and the only record
# of what a successful run looked like on hardware; normalising them is the same
# mistake as letting prettier reflow the retrospectives, which happened on
# 2026-08-30. Nothing in this repo reads them — they are read by people.
archive/** -text
